Patch mode: comparisons
use only the source
lines quoted in the
patches.

═══════════════════════
*    DELTA DIFFERENCES*
═══════════════════════
Signs mark edits made
by only that patch. A
sign-less line with one
number is an edit both
patches make: a new
number means both add
it, an old number means
both remove it.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 old new│m.┃ old new│m.
        │tx┃        │tx
        │t ┃        │t
        │@@┃        │@@
        │ a┃        │ a
   1   1│a ┃   1   1│a
-  2    │b ┃   2   2│b
+      2│B ┃        │
   3   3│c ┃   3   3│c
   4   4│d ┃-  4    │d
        │  ┃+      4│D
   5   5│e ┃   5   5│e

═══════════════════════
*  CONTEXT DIFFERENCES*
═══════════════════════
Signs mark lines
present in only one
result: - patch1, +
patch2.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
